<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>

당신은 채찍을 휘둘렀다.
<br><br>

<<if $prisoner.harmedRecently gte 4 and $prisoner.harmed gte Math.floor($prisoner.love / 4) or $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
